      "description": "Kagoshima City Aquarium (Io World) showcases the rich marine life of the Kuroshio Current that flows past Kagoshima. Its star attraction is the massive Kuroshio Tank featuring whale sharks, the world's largest fish. The aquarium offers dolphin shows and interactive touch pools, all with Sakurajima volcano as the backdrop.",
